        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 5100P, Providence Keyed Knob with Round Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Key in Providence Knob with Regular Rose is a traditional half round knobset that is available in both a keyed and dummy function. The keyed entry is operated by a key from the exterior and a thumbturn from the interior while a dummy knob is just for looks and does not latch nor lock. Emtek's Providence Keyed Knob with Round Rose will fit doors with backsets of 2-3/8 inches and 2-3/4 inches that are 1-1/4 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick. Choose from a wide array of classic finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> for the Emtek Traditional Half Round Knob with Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Dimeter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Thickness: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: 1-1/4\" - 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry (Keyed Lock):</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. The lock is operated by a key from the exterior and a thumbturn on the knob from the interior. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, keys, door latch, and strike plate.\r\n<li><b>Dummy:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-8-finish.jpg?v=1704354509\" width=\"600\" height=\"102\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Key in Providence Knob with Regular Rose",
                "description": "The Key in Providence Knob with Regular Rose is a traditional half round knobset that is available in both a keyed and dummy function. The keyed entry is operated by a key from the exterior and a thumbturn from the interior while a dummy knob is just for looks and does not latch nor lock. Emtek's Providence Keyed Knob with Round Rose will fit doors with backsets of 2-3/8 inches and 2-3/4 inches that are 1-1/4 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick. Choose from a wide array of classic finishes.",
